rea, and find a ??? on some crates just outside the Duty-Free Shop (Jeuno) at (Port Jeuno (H-8)).",["zone"]="Port Jeuno",["grid"]="H-8",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Click on the ??? for a cutscene and ask to have the gloves repaired.",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Go to Castle Zvahl Baileys (F-8) and touch one of the torches to spawn Dark Spark.",["zone"]="Castle Zvahl Baileys",["grid"]="F-8",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Kill Dark Spark.",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Touch one of the torches again to receive the Key item: Shadow Flames.\010\010If other players in the party also need this key item, they can touch the torch at this time as well; you do not need to fight Dark Spark for each party member who needs the Key item: Shadow Flames.",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Head back to Port Jeuno and click on the ??? at the toolbox for another cutscene and your Temple Gloves. This completes the quest.",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Optional\010\010The quest must be active or completed in order for the following coffers to yield their respective artifact attire.\010\010These coffers are not required to complete the quest.\010\010You must have Monk as your main job when you open these coffers.",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Guslam mentions something about armor scattered about Vana'diel. You can find two more pieces of armor by opening coffers in the following zones:\010\010Garlaige Citadel: Temple Crown\010\010Beadeaux: Temple Cyclas",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""}},["review"]="Imported from wiki; not verified in game.",["warnings"]="",["group"]="Quests",["jobs"]={"Monk (MNK)"},["job_sources"]={{["job"]="Monk (MNK)",["kind"]="Artifact quest",["page"]="Temple Gloves",["revision"]="114073"},{["job"]="Monk (MNK)",["kind"]="Artifact quest",["page"]="Temple Crown",["revision"]="19368"},{["job"]="Monk (MNK)",["kind"]="Artifact quest",["page"]="Temple Cyclas",["revision"]="34712"},{["job"]="Monk (MNK)",["kind"]="Artifact quest",["page"]="Borghertz's Striking Hands",["revision"]="73748"}},["start_zones"]={"Upper Jeuno"},["step_zones"]={"Beadeaux","Castle Zvahl Baileys","Crawlers' Nest","Garlaige Citadel","Lower Jeuno","Port Jeuno","Upper Jeuno"}},{["id"]="wiki_1150",["title"]="Borghertz's Vermillion Hands",["page_title"]="Borghertz's Vermillion Hands",["kind"]="quest",["availability"]="unverified",["source"]="https://horizonffxi.wiki/Borghertz%27s_Vermillion_Hands",["revision"]="2413",["requirements"]="Start: Guslam \226\128\148 Upper Jeuno (H-8)\010Requirements: Red Mage 50+\010Must have started Enveloped in Darkness\010Items: Eldieme Coffer Key\010Key item: Old Gauntlets\010Key item: Shadow Flames\010Optional:\010Garlaige Coffer Key\010Oztroja Coffer Key\010Previous: Enveloped in Darkness",["rewards"]="Warlock's Gloves\010Optional:\010Warlock's Tights\010Warlock's Tabard",["repeatable"]="af",["summary"]="Gauntlets wrought by Borghertz, the legendary craftsman, lie hidden somewhere in Vana'diel.",["changes"]="",["steps"]={{["text"]="If you have any other Borghertz's Hands quest active, you must complete that one before you can start this quest.",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Speak to Guslam at Upper Jeuno (H-8) in the Durable Shields shop and accept the quest.\010\010After starting the quest, you can obtain the rewards in any order.",["zone"]="Upper Jeuno",["grid"]="H-8",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Main Quest",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Head to The Eldieme Necropolis and open a coffer there, so either:\010\010Obtain a Eldieme Coffer Key or\010\010Come as a Thief and bring along Thief's Tools to pick the lock (see Picking your Coffers and Chests).\010You will obtain a pair of Key item: Old Gauntlets from the coffer.",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Head back to Upper Jeuno and talk to Guslam again, who tells you he cannot repair them.",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="If this is your first time completing AF gear (for any job), do the following: \010\010Deadly Minnow, behind the counter in the same shop, will tell you to find a Mithra at the Tenshodo for more information.\010\010Go to Lower Jeuno and go into Neptune's Spire and talk to Yin Pocanakhu at (Lower Jeuno (J-8)). Pay her 1,000 gil to hear her story.",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Head to Port Jeuno, go downstairs into the Auction House area, and find a ??? on some crates just outside the Duty-Free Shop (Jeuno) at (Port Jeuno (H-8)).",["zone"]="Port Jeuno",["grid"]="H-8",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Click on the ??? for a cutscene and ask to have the gloves repaired.",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Go to Castle Zvahl Baileys (F-8) and touch one of the torches to spawn Dark Spark.",["zone"]="Castle Zvahl Baileys",["grid"]="F-8",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Kill Dark Spark.",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Touch one of the torches again to receive the Key item: Shadow Flames.\010\010If other players in the party also need this key item, they can touch the torch at this time as well; you do not need to fight Dark Spark for each party member who needs the Key item: Shadow Flames.",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Head back to Port Jeuno and click on the ??? at the toolbox for another cutscene and your Warlock's Gloves. This completes the quest.",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Optional\010\010The quest must be active or completed in order for the following coffers to yield their respective artifact attire.\010\010These coffers are not required to complete the quest.\010\010You must have Red Mage as your main job when you open these coffers.",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Guslam mentions something about armor scattered about Vana'diel. You can find two more pieces of armor by opening coffers in the following zones:\010\010Garlaige Citadel: Warlock's Tights\010\010Castle Oztroja: Warlock's Tabard",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=