 (26-28)\010 Quick walk from Aragoneu Outpost. \010 3 camps/supports 3 parties. \01019-22\010Carpenters' Landing\010 Center Landing Docks (Carpenters' Landing (H-6) / Map 1)\010 Orcish Cursemaker\010 Orcish Fighter\010 Orcish Serjeant (21-25)\010 Fosse Pugil (22-24)\010 Forest Tiger (22-25)\010 Use Northwest entrance from Jugner Forest at (Jugner Forest (E-6)).\010 Sight and Sound aggro on the way to camp.\01019-22\010Davoi\010 Main Entrance (Davoi (J-7))\010 Orcish Cursemaker\010 Orcish Fighter\010 Orcish Serjeant (22-28)\010 Bats that pop at night aggro via sound.\01019-22\010Yughott Grotto\010 Map 2: (Yughott Grotto (J-6) / Map 2)\010 Map 2: (Yughott Grotto (J-9) / Map 2)\010 Orcish Cursemaker\010 Orcish Fighter\010 Orcish Serjeant (21-23)\010 Sight and sound aggro on the way to camp.\010 All orcs link by sight, be careful.",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Level 20-30\010\010+\010width=\"8%\" | Level\010width=\"17%\" | Zone\010width=\"18%\" | Camp\010width=\"17%\" | Mob(s)\010width=\"40%\" | Notes\01020-22\010Rolanberry Fields\010 Between Fences at (Rolanberry Fields (F-7))\010 Shack at (Rolanberry Fields (F-11)) \010 Stone Wall/Signpost at (Rolanberry Fields (H-12)) \010 Crates at (Rolanberry Fields (I-10))\010 Death Wasp (23-26)\010 Berry Grub (25-28)\010 Quadav and Ochu aggro sound. \010 Can fill in with Bats at night.\01020-23\010Ordelle's Caves\010 Waterfall/PLD ??? (Ordelle's Caves (G-7) / Map 2)\010 Shrieker (25-27)\010 Clipper (26-29)\010 Goliath Beetle (29-31)\010 Enter through La Theine Plateau at (La Theine Plateau (H-7)).\010 Sight and sound aggro near camp.\010 Clippers link by sound. \010 Bomb nearby. \010 Supports 1 party.\01021-23\010The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah\010 Zone to Meriphataud, (The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (G-10))\010 Ancient Bat (26-28)\010 Goblin Gambler\010 Goblin Mugger (26-29)\010 Southwest part of the zone is littered with Goblins and Bats. \010 Beware of links. \010 Beware of Rock Golem (magic sensitive and will destroy your 