Excellent bridge to 60.\01050\226\128\14753\010Desert Worm\01059\226\128\14761\010Western Altepa Desert\010(F-7)\010Alternate camp.\01051\226\128\14756\010Muddyeyes\01062\226\128\14766\010Eastern Altepa Desert\010(I-10)\010Good follow-up camp.\01053\226\128\14756\010Desert Slime\01061\226\128\14764\010Western Altepa Desert\010(H-10)\010High HP target.\01057\226\128\14762\010Glacier Crab\01069\226\128\14772\010Beaucedine Glacier\010(J-9)\010High-level Glacier camp.\01065\226\128\14768\010Meadow Buffalo\01075\226\128\14778\010Lufaise Meadows\010(K-9)\010Pre-merit bridge.\01064\226\128\14775\010Coastal Slime\01078\226\128\14781\010Misareaux Coast\010(G-8)\010Merit camp.\01064\226\128\14775\010Ice Crab\01081\226\128\14782\010Xarcabard\010(I-9)\010Merit camp.\01066\226\128\14775\010Icefallo\01081\226\128\14782\010Xarcabard\010(I-8)\010Endgame Magic Burst camp.",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""}},["review"]="Not verified in game.",["warnings"]="Community reference: may include outdated, retail-only or conditional information. It is not a verified recommendation.",["group"]="Reference guides",["jobs"]={},["job_sources"]={},["start_zones"]={},["step_zones"]={}},{["id"]="wiki_10552",["title"]="Map Guide",["page_title"]="Map Guide",["kind"]="guide",["availability"]="unverified",["source"]="https://horizonffxi.wiki/Map_Guide",["revision"]="107152",["requirements"]="Reference material. Check the linked wiki for updates.",["rewards"]="Not applicable",["repeatable"]="Not applicable",["summary"]="",["changes"]="",["steps"]={{["text"]="Introduction\010\010This has been adapted from: https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Map_Guide",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Maps on Horizon [Horizon change]\010\010On Horizon we have access to the very handy \"Allmaps\" addon which allows you to see the map for a zone you are in. Historically, in retail you would have needed to obtain the map as a Key Item in order to do this. \010However, on Horizon you still need to obtain the key item if you wish to view the map of a different zone to the one you are in.\010The content of this guide is presented for those who wish to obtain the maps for this reason, or for completion. \010You begin the game with a map of your home city and the surrounding area, but additional maps can be acquired in variety of ways.",["zone"]="",["grid"]="",["npc"]=""},{["text"]="Purchased\010\010Area  |  NPC  |  Location  |  Price\010San d'Oria Area\010Karine\010Rex\010Elesca\010Violitte\010Mhoji Roccoruh\010Pehki Machumaht\010Ludwig\010Lombaria\010Bastok Markets (H-9)\010Port Bastok (J-7)\010Northern San d'Oria (I-8)\010Southern San d'Oria (G-10)\010Port Windurst (G-9)\010Windurst Woods (H-11)\010Mhaura (H-9)\010Selbina (I-7)\010200g\010Bastok Area\010Karine\010Rex\010Elesca\010Violitte\010Mhoji Roccoruh\010Pehki Machumaht\010Ludwig\010Lombaria\010Bastok Markets (H-9)\010Port Bastok (J-7)\010Northern San d'Oria (I-8)\010Southern San d'Oria (G-10)\010Port Windurst (G-9)\010Windurst Woods (H-11)\010Mhaura (H-9)\010Selbina (I-7)\010200g\010Windurst Area\010Karine\010Rex\010Elesca\010Violitte\010Mhoji Roccoruh\010Pehki Machumaht\010Ludwig\010Lombaria\010Bastok Markets (H-9)\010Port Bastok (J-7)\010Northern San d'Oria (I-8)\010Southern San d'Oria (G-10)\010Port Windurst (G-9)\010Windurst Woods (H-11)\010Mhaura (H-9)\010Selbina (I-7)\010200g\010Jeuno Area\010Karine\010Rex\010Elesca\010Violitte\010Mhoji Roccoruh\010Pehki Machumaht\010Ludwig\010Lombaria\010Bastok Markets (H-9)\010Port Bastok (J-7)\010Northern San d'Oria (I-8)\010Southern San d'Oria (G-10)\010Port Windurst (G-9)\010Windurst Woods (H-11)\010Mhaura (H-9)\010Selbina (I-7)\010600g\010Qufim Island\010Promurouve\010Rusese\010Lower Jeuno (H-7)\010Upper Jeuno (H-6)\0103,000g\010Zeruhn Mines\010Karine\010Rex\010Bastok Markets (H-9)\010Port Bastok (J-7)\010200g\010Ordelle's Caves\010Elesca\010Violitte\010Northern San d'Oria (I-8)\010Southern San d'Oria (G-10)\010600g\010Maze of Shakhrami\010Mhoji Roccoruh\010Pehki Machum